{"t":"Snake Eye","s":"snake-eye-9dc53","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Snake Eye</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOutlaw Camp\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subarea\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Subarea</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145909&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32657,32189,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32657, 32189, 8)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Barkeeper</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230826103425&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snake_Eye_36c6f2.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Snake Eye.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>The bar below ground in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>He got in a fight with a snake and lost one eye. If you mention Cip to him, he will break the fourth wall by responding with <i>Cip sux!</i>\nPart of <a href=\"#/quest/the-thieves-guild-quest\">The Thieves Guild Quest</a>, mission 4.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Bread\"><img alt=\"Brown Bread\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brown_Bread_ec87ae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Bread\">Brown Bread</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\"><img alt=\"Fish\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fish_332645.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">6 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>1</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>2</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">6 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-2\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Wine\">Wine</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Snake Eye.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Snake Eye</strong>: Hi <i>Player</i>. Come in and have a drink.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>drink</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: I can offer you beer and wine. Ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Well, I'm the boss of this tavern.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>tavern</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: It's a great tavern. No closing time. No problems with kings or other rulers. Best place in Tibia.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: I'm <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Snake Eye</strong>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Snake Eye</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Well, I had a dispute with a snake once. And the snake won. Bit my left eye out. Therefore, Snake Eye.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Tibia/Tibiasula</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: There's already too much order in Tibia. We don't need kings or whatever.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: We don't need one.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Go and get a watch.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/H.L.\">H.L.</a></b><br/>\nSnake Eye: He is a wild warrior. Nobody knows his real name. We just call im H.L. You can find him in the small armory shop.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>wild warrior</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: There are a lot of wild warriors around. They built this camp.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">camp</a></b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Well, the real wild warriors don't live here. They hide in the woods.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>woods</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: It's the best place to live. By the way, there's an old wild warrior building to the southwest. It might be interesting for you.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hide</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Well. I know of a small camp to the south.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>south</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: It's abandoned. But I bet that something is hidden there!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hidden</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Go and find out yourself. You can tell me if you find something.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a></b><br/>\nSnake Eye: I've never been there. I don't like the elves anyway.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a></b><br/>\nSnake Eye: I've never been there. Don't know anything about it.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></b><br/>\nSnake Eye: That's a place for wealthy toffs!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Kazordoon is alright. Except the dwarfs. I don't like them. But the mountains are a good place. Been there once.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></b><br/>\nSnake Eye: In the beginning, it was a nice encampment. Now it's an overcrowded, polluted city. I hate it!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>water</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Water is for free. Do you want some?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>god</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: The Gods of Tibia! What a crap! It's all superstition!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>crap</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Crap. Crap! CRAP! It's all CRAP!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>superstition</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Believe me! There are no gods.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Durin</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: He's the worst. The so called god of the dwarves. I don't believe it. It's all crap.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Guido</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Never heard of him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Stephan</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Never heard of him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Steve</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Never heard of him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Cip</b><br/>\nSnake Eye: Cip sux!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b> (female)<br/>\nSnake Eye: Get lost, stinky dragon.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b> (male)<br/>\nSnake Eye: Bye.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Snake Eye</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["the-thieves-guild-quest","the-travelling-trader-quest"],"pos":{"x":32657,"y":32189,"z":8}}